data.value:
# GameDevManager export

Project: {0}
Format version: {1}

All content sits as JSON under `content/`, one file per module. Entities refer to each other exclusively through GUIDs — every `…Id` property is the `id` of an entity from one of the other files. User-defined types and fields are in `content/types-and-fields.json`, their values in `content/field-values.json`, conditions in `content/conditions.json`, tags in `content/tags.json`.

The metadata of the uploaded files is in `content/assets.json`; the files themselves sit under `assets/files/` — their path there is the `storageKey` from the metadata. `project.json` is the manifest of the export (format version, timestamp, number of entries per module).
